                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Tipo reward</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="reward_type">
                                    <option value="experience">Esperienza</option>
                                    <option value="item">Oggetto</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Seleziona il tipo prima di compilare i campi specifici.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-2">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Visibilità</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="visibility">
                                    <option value="public">Pubblica</option>
                                    <option value="player_private">Privata player</option>
                                    <option value="staff_only">Solo staff</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text"><b>player_private</b> = visibile solo al destinatario; <b>staff_only</b> = non visibile ai player.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-5" data-role="admin-quest-reward-item-wrap">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Oggetto (guidato)</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="item_label" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Cerca oggetto..." data-role="admin-quest-reward-item-label">
                                <input type="hidden" name="reward_reference_id" value="0">
                                <div class="list-group mt-1 d-none" data-role="admin-quest-reward-item-suggestions"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-2">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Quantità</label>
                                <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="item_quantity" min="1" value="1">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Esperienza</label>
                                <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="experience_amount" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00">
                                <div class="form-text">Utilizzato solo se il tipo è <code>experience</code>.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-2 d-flex align-items-end">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary w-100" data-action="admin-quest-reward-assign"><i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i>Assegna</button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="quest-staff-panel">
                    <div class="quest-staff-panel__header">
                        <span class="quest-panel__eyebrow">Storico</span>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="quest-staff-panel__title"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-1"></i>Ricompense assegnate</span>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ms-auto" data-action="admin-quest-rewards-reload" style="padding:2px 8px;"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="quest-staff-panel__body p-0">
                        <div id="admin-quest-rewards-list" class="list-group list-group-flush"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{# ── Log progressione quest ───────────────────────────────── #}
<div class="modal fade" id="admin-quest-logs-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow">Storico</div>
                    <h5 class="modal-title"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-2"></i>Log progressione quest</h5>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Chiudi"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="quest-staff-panel mb-3">
                    <div class="quest-staff-panel__header">
                        <span class="quest-panel__eyebrow">Filtri</span>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="quest-staff-panel__title"><i class="bi bi-funnel me-1"></i>Ricerca log</span>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ms-auto" data-action="admin-quest-logs-reload" style="padding:2px 8px;"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="quest-staff-panel__body">
                        <div class="form-text mb-2">I log tracciano ogni evento sul ciclo di vita della quest: cambi di stato, step, esiti applicati e override staff. Usa i filtri per restringere la ricerca.</div>
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Istanza (guidata)</label>
                                <input type="text" id="admin-quest-logs-filter-instance-label" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Cerca istanza...">
                                <input type="hidden" id="admin-quest-logs-filter-instance-id" value="0">
                                <div class="list-group mt-1 d-none" data-role="admin-quest-logs-instance-suggestions"></div>
                                <div class="form-text">Lascia vuoto per vedere i log di tutte le istanze di questa quest.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Tipo log</label>
                                <select id="admin-quest-logs-filter-type-preset" class="form-select form-select-sm" data-role="admin-quest-logs-filter-type-preset">
                                    <option value="">Tutti</option>
                                    <option value="quest_status_changed">Cambio stato quest</option>
                                    <option value="step_status_changed">Cambio stato step</option>
                                    <option value="outcome_applied">Esito applicato</option>
                                    <option value="condition_matched">Condizione soddisfatta</option>
                                    <option value="staff_override">Override staff</option>
                                    <option value="maintenance">Manutenzione</option>
                                    <option value="custom">Altro (avanzato)</option>
                                </select>
                                <input type="text" id="admin-quest-logs-filter-type-custom" class="form-control form-control-sm mt-1 d-none" maxlength="80" placeholder="Inserisci tipo log personalizzato...">
                                <input type="hidden" id="admin-quest-logs-filter-type" value="">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="admin-quest-logs-list" class="list-group"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{# ── Crea / modifica definizione quest ────────────────────── #}
<div class="modal fade" id="admin-quest-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow">Definizione</div>
                    <h5 class="modal-title"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-2"></i>Crea / modifica quest</h5>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Chiudi"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <form id="admin-quest-form" class="row g-3">
                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="0">

                    {# — Identificazione — #}
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow mb-2">Identificazione</div>
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Slug <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="slug" maxlength="100" required>
                                <div class="form-text">Identificatore univoco interno (es. <code>missione_del_tramonto</code>). Non modificare dopo la pubblicazione.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Titolo <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="title" maxlength="255" required>
                                <div class="form-text">Nome della quest visibile ai player (se visibilità lo consente).</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {# — Configurazione — #}
                    <div class="col-12 quest-divider-top pt-3">
                        <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow mb-2">Configurazione</div>
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Tipo quest</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="quest_type">
                                    <option value="personal">Personale</option>
                                    <option value="faction">Fazione</option>
                                    <option value="guild">Gilda</option>
                                    <option value="world">Mondo</option>
                                    <option value="storyline">Trama</option>
                                    <option value="event">Evento</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Influenza il gruppo di assegnatari predefinito e le regole di visibilità.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Stato</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="status">
                                    <option value="draft">Bozza</option>
                                    <option value="published">Pubblicata</option>
                                    <option value="archived">Archiviata</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text"><b>draft</b> = non visibile nel sistema; <b>published</b> = attiva; <b>archived</b> = disattivata.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Visibilità</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="visibility">
                                    <option value="public">Pubblica</option>
                                    <option value="private">Privata</option>
                                    <option value="staff_only">Solo staff</option>
                                    <option value="hidden">Nascosta</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Controlla chi può vedere la quest nell'interfaccia (indipendente dallo stato).</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Disponibilità</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="availability_type">
                                    <option value="manual_join">Adesione manuale</option>
                                    <option value="staff_assign">Assegnazione staff</option>
                                    <option value="auto_join">Assegnazione automatica</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text"><b>manual_join</b> = il player si iscrive autonomamente; <b>staff_assign</b> = solo lo staff può assegnare; <b>auto_join</b> = il sistema assegna automaticamente.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Intensità narrativa</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="intensity_level">
                                    <option value="CHILL">CHILL</option>
                                    <option value="SOFT">SOFT</option>
                                    <option value="STANDARD" selected>STANDARD</option>
                                    <option value="HIGH">HIGH</option>
                                    <option value="CRITICAL">CRITICAL</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Indica la pressione narrativa della quest, non la difficoltà meccanica.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Visibilità intensità</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="intensity_visibility">
                                    <option value="visible" selected>Visibile</option>
                                    <option value="hidden">Nascosta</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Se nascosta, il livello di intensità non viene mostrato ai player nella UI di gioco.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Ordine</label>
                                <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="sort_order" min="0" value="0">
                                <div class="form-text">Posizione nelle liste ordinate. Usa gap (10, 20…) per inserimenti futuri.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {# — Ambito — #}
                    <div class="col-12 quest-divider-top pt-3">
                        <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow mb-2">Ambito</div>
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Tipo ambito</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="scope_type" data-role="admin-quest-scope-type">
                                    <option value="world">Mondo</option>
                                    <option value="character">Personaggio</option>
                                    <option value="faction">Fazione</option>
                                    <option value="guild">Gilda</option>
                                    <option value="map">Mappa</option>
                                    <option value="location">Luogo</option>
                                </select>
                                <div class="form-text">Ambito geografico o organizzativo in cui opera la quest. <b>world</b> = nessun ambito specifico.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-7">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Target ambito (guidato)</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" name="scope_label" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Cerca per nome..." data-role="admin-quest-scope-label">
                                <input type="hidden" name="scope_id" value="0">
                                <div class="list-group mt-1 d-none" data-role="admin-quest-scope-suggestions"></div>
                                <div class="form-text">Lascia vuoto se il tipo ambito è <code>world</code>.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {# — Contenuto — #}
                    <div class="col-12 quest-divider-top pt-3">
                        <div class="quest-panel__eyebrow mb-2">Contenuto</div>
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Sommario</label>
                                <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm richtext-editor" name="summary" rows="2"></textarea>
                                <div class="form-text">Descrizione breve mostrata nelle liste e anteprime. Tieni sotto le 200 parole.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Descrizione</label>
                                <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm richtext-editor" name="description" rows="5"></textarea>
                                <div class="form-text">Testo completo della quest, visibile al player quando apre il dettaglio.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <label class="form-label form-label-sm">Tag narrativi</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm mb-1" data-role="admin-quest-tags-filter" placeholder="Filtra tag..." autocomplete="off">
                                <div class="border rounded p-2 quest-tags-box" data-role="admin-quest-tags-checkboxes">
                                    <span class="small text-muted">Caricamento tag...</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-text">Massimo 8 tag per quest. Usati per filtrare e raggruppare nell'interfaccia.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </form>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annulla</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="admin-quest-save"><i class="bi bi-floppy me-1"></i>Salva</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
